{"id":"cc477931ad2a","path":"/en/university/who-we-are/facts-and-figures/graduates-diplomas","lang":"en","title":"USI key figures: graduates and degrees","description":"Laureati e diplomi in cifre.","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Who we are","Key figures"],"image":null,"words":78,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/chi-siamo/dati-e-cifre/laureati-diplomi","en":"/en/university/who-we-are/facts-and-figures/graduates-diplomas"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/university"},{"label":"Who we are","path":"/en/university/who-we-are"},{"label":"Key figures","path":"/en/university/who-we-are/facts-and-figures"},{"label":"USI key figures: graduates and degrees","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>Graduates and degrees in figures.</p><p>Latest data available.</p><p><strong>Definitions</strong></p> <p><strong>Graduates</strong> are students who have obtained a degree at USI; students who have obtained more than one degree (e.g., Bachelor’s degree + Master’s degree, Master’s degree + Ph.D…) are counted only once, from the last degree obtained.</p> <p><strong>Diplomas</strong> are all the diplomas awarded at USI, regardless of the above mentioned differentiations. The statistics do not include titles of continuing education programmes.</p> <p><strong>Detailed figures</strong></p> <p>For further figures, please contact <a href=\"mailto:press@usi.ch\">press@usi.ch</a></p>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[],"links":[{"label":"Institutional Communication Service","href":"https://search.usi.ch/en/organisational-units/155/institutional-communication-service"},{"label":"+41 58 666 47 92","href":"tel:+41586664792"},{"label":"press@usi.ch","href":"mailto:press@usi.ch"},{"label":"Data on education","href":"/en/university/who-we-are/facts-and-figures/education"},{"label":"Data on students","href":"/en/university/who-we-are/facts-and-figures/students"},{"label":"Bachelor's programmes","href":"/en/education/bachelor"},{"label":"Master'